{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:12 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:12 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:12 2026-10-18 HKT</p><p>重陽節加上周末長假，亦是新皇崗口岸開通後首個周末。《星島頭條》緊貼每日出入境狀況。</p><h2>10.18︱中午實施人流管制</h2><p>重陽節正日，新皇崗口岸出境人潮逼爆，保安局「口岸通」首亮黃燈，即「繁忙」。內地社交平台小紅書及網上圖片可見，往深圳方向現場中午時分已實施人流管制。</p><img alt=\"新皇崗口岸人潮逼爆。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bef261a3ae8b56683df9d2fd3e836b9/2026-10/A21_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0aa998bdd916cdda360d25803f6695f2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_13_47_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f21eeae161359620d42873f437619b9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_13_47_32.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"新皇崗口岸「出境」方向，「口岸通」網頁顯示黃燈，以示「繁忙」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c04cf2ab8349bd336769a50f8ba1bf6e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_13_35_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/587f000b7d3b546ac75fbb83f4403bad/2026-10/A17_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5159952a05332f3b7c62336fb4c79a1/2026-10/A18_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d5b417c5ed1e9075c73192d47c68d0c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_13_29_10_0.jpeg\"/><h2>10.17︱首個周六有逾13萬人次使用皇崗口岸</h2><p>入境處數字顯示，周六（10月17日）全日有逾13萬人次經皇崗口岸出入境，其中入境有55,703人次、出境有74,661人次。而各口岸累計全日有逾135萬人次出入境，出境人次達84萬。</p><img alt=\"新皇崗口岸10月12日開通。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14a1e60bbf61570f4d5f034587644523/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_070222491_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5921a59881652765417b6ca858aabd2b/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_02_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0269769910ab72c6c00f8d3d47bca9ba/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c29db8177dc8bd47812eb18a10bd04bf/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_08.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/defb5045faeae4f9ac59584fde977b6e/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_09.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T06:38:54.518462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T05:12:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:38.703112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T06:37:39.163691+00:00","content_hash":"243a9cd43c27ff08d8cd2f075c539ba74de5ae0873fe5bae67a61e73eb85e8aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}